{title: Abhi Mujhme Kahin}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Agnipath Ajay Atul}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D],        Abhi mujh mein kahin, baaqui
[G] [D] [Bm] [F#],        thodi si hai zindagi
[D],        Jagi dhadkan nayi, jaana
[G] [D] [Bm] [F#],        zinda hoon main toh abhi
[G] [A] [G] [A],        Kuch aisi lagan iss lamhe mein hai
[E] [G] [A],        Ye lamha kahaan tha mera
[D] [G] [D] [G],        Ab hai saamne Ise chhoo loon zara
